<title>USA: North Plainfield, N.J., won by Commerce Capital.</title>
<headline>North Plainfield, N.J., won by Commerce Capital.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Commerce Capital said it won $4.025 million of North Plainfield, N.J., various general obligation bonds, with a net interest cost of 5.032 percent.</p>
</text>
